     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ImplementationGuide smart.who.int.ccc</b></p><a name=\"smart.who.int.ccc\"> </a><a name=\"hcsmart.who.int.ccc\"> </a><h2>Ccc</h2><p>The official URL for this implementation guide is: </p><pre>https://smart.who.int/ccc/ImplementationGuide/smart.who.int.ccc</pre><div><p>This implementation guide provides implementation resources and guidance in support of applying the WHO recommendations on emergency care.&lt;br/&gt;This implementation guide is part of the WHO Smart Guidelines approach to support countries to integrate WHO global data and health recommendations into digital systems accurately and consistently.</p>\n</div></div>"
